   "source": [
    "# Fine-Tuning Mistral-7B-Instruct-v0.3 for Enterprise Financial Document Intelligence\n",
    "\n",
    "This notebook trains **Mistral-7B-Instruct-v0.3** using **4-bit QLoRA** to act as a grounded financial synthesizer with:\n",
    "1. **Strict Citation Enforcement**: Mandatory `[Ticker, Year, Section]` citation anchors.\n",
    "2. **Refusal Protocol**: Explicit refusal whenever disclosures lack evidence, eliminating financial hallucinations.\n",
    "3. **Loss Masking**: Backpropagating gradients exclusively across assistant response tokens.\n",
    "\n",
    "> **Hardware Requirement**: Google Colab Free Tier **T4 GPU** (16 GB VRAM) or any NVIDIA GPU (A10G, A100, RTX 3090/4090)."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 1. Verify GPU Hardware Acceleration"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "!nvidia-smi"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 2. Install Required Dependencies"
   ]
  },
